      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Balloon angioplasty for restenosis has a higher success rate and a lower complication rate as compared to PTCA in de-novo-lesions. The restenosis rate after a second or third PTCA is only slightly higher than after a first PTCA. So far, balloon dilatation is the most effective and most economic treatment for restenosis."},
